{"path":"container/list/size","title":"std::list<T,Allocator>::size","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::list&lt;T,Allocator&gt;::</span>size","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/list/size","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the number of elements in the container, i.e. std::distance(begin(), end()).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-until-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">size_type size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">size_type size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the number of elements in the container, i.e. <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/distance\"><span class=\"kw678\">std::<span class=\"me2\">distance</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>begin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, end<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The number of elements in the container.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-until-cxx11\"><td>Constant or linear.</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx11\"><td>Constant.</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>The following code uses <code>size</code> to display the number of elements in a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list\">std::list</a></span>:</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;list&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span> \n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list\"><span class=\"kw1283\">std::<span class=\"me2\">list</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> nums<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">7</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"nums contains \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> nums.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" elements.<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>nums contains 4 elements.</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list/empty\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>empty</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks whether the container  is empty <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list/max_size\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>max_size</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the maximum possible number of elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list/resize\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>resize</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  changes the number of elements stored <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/list","title":"std::list"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::list<T,Allocator>::size","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: until C++11, since C++11. Returns the number of elements in the container, i.e. std::distance(begin(), end())."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The number of elements in the container."},{"label":"Complexity"},{"label":"Example","note":"The following code uses size to display the number of elements in a std::list:"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"empty","note":"checks whether the container is empty"},{"label":"max_size","note":"returns the maximum possible number of elements"},{"label":"resize","note":"changes the number of elements stored"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":118,"codeBlockCount":2}
